      "originalText": "• Pessimistic row locking kernel\n• 4-Decimal precision (@Digits 14,4)\n• Transactional Outbox pattern (<15ms)\n• Kafka Command Producer & Consumer\n• Customer OTP verification for >₱50k\n• Scales out when Kafka lag > 50 msgs",
      "lineHeight": 1.45
    },
