      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8102,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "• Dedicated Linux VM (Standard_D2s_v5) with\n  attached Azure Premium SSD Managed Disk\n• Kernel: Pessimistic Row Locking Kernel\n  (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE) on balance_master\n• Strict Check Constraints:\n  CHECK (balance_amount >= hold_amount >= 0)\n• Master Schema Tables:\n  users, accounts, balance_master,\n  transactions, outbox_events\n• Concurrency Protection:\n  HikariCP pool caps active connections at 30;\n  Transactional Outbox returns HTTP 202 in <15ms.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11.5,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Dedicated Linux VM (Standard_D2s_v5) with\n  attached Azure Premium SSD Managed Disk\n• Kernel: Pessimistic Row Locking Kernel\n  (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE) on balance_master\n• Strict Check Constraints:\n  CHECK (balance_amount >= hold_amount >= 0)\n• Master Schema Tables:\n  users, accounts, balance_master,\n  transactions, outbox_events\n• Concurrency Protection:\n  HikariCP pool caps active connections at 30;\n  Transactional Outbox returns HTTP 202 in <15ms.",
      "lineHeight": 1.48
    },
