      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8127,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "• Eliminates plaintext credentials in files and git\n• Microservices authenticate via System-Assigned\n  Managed Identity with zero static tokens\n• Centralized Secrets:\n  - Oracle DB & PostgreSQL audit passwords\n  - Cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 JWT secret\n  - SendGrid SMTP credentials & Datadog API keys\n• Automatic certificate renewal & audit logging",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11.5,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Eliminates plaintext credentials in files and git\n• Microservices authenticate via System-Assigned\n  Managed Identity with zero static tokens\n• Centralized Secrets:\n  - Oracle DB & PostgreSQL audit passwords\n  - Cryptographic HMAC-SHA256 JWT secret\n  - SendGrid SMTP credentials & Datadog API keys\n• Automatic certificate renewal & audit logging",
      "lineHeight": 1.48
    },
